<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, magnify the Lord with me,</l><l>With me exalt His name;</l><l>When in distress to Him I called,</l><l>He to my rescue came.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The hosts of God encamp around</l><l>The dwellings of the just;</l><l>Deliverance He affords to all</l><l>Who on His succor trust.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, make but trial of His love,</l><l>Experience will decide</l><l>How blest they are, and only they,</l><l>Who in His truth confide.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Fear Him, ye saints, and you will then</l><l>Have nothing else to fear;</l><l>Make you His service your delight,</l><l>Your wants shall be His care.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
